  "display_name": "Storm Kick",
  "display_fullname": "Brute Melee Martial Arts Storm Kick",
  "display_help": "You can unleash a roundhouse kick that pummels your foe for moderate damage.  Storm Kick boosts the Tanker's defense against melee, ranged and area of effect damage slightly for a short period of time after hitting their foe.  This bonus defense doesn't stack with itself and is unenhanceable.  Damage: Moderate, Recharge: Medium",
